bb887d8e0f"},{"id":"cmpr8hc4o00dgpyhn3vkxa0zx","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Christmas Party","old_title_md5":"716b238d2748cb80c22c7b078def9061","set_desc":true,"description":"Date: Friday December 03, 2010\nTime: 8:00pm\nLocation: GNOTRI Sports / Kona Cafe\n\nCost: Free to NOH3 Hashers that have hashed in 2010.\nNon-hashers/guests $20\nAttire: Dressy! Men should wear pants & Sport coat. NO JEANS please.\nGift Exchange Details: Please bring a wrapped gift that costs between $15-$20. You must bring a gift to participate in the gift exchange.","old_desc_md5":"9194c2134e1d07e4a7548a0322891a1d"},{"id":"cmpr8hccz00dkpyhnqx05b5bp","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1166","old_title_md5":"b2827d800b3ae6a692db52f270552e01","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bend Over Rover & IHOV","old_hares_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":1166,"old_run":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: Bend Over Rover & IHOV\nLOC: Bonnabel Boat Launch\n$6 Hash\n3:00pm Show / 3:30 Go\n\nSaints Away Game at NOON.\nFor those interested, they can watch game at my house 1516 Homestead Ave, Metairie, La 70005. On dead end by lake just 5 blocks from Bonnabel. We will have some food and beer, etc and others are welcome to bring a dish or not. Also have hot tub but not sure if heater is working. Have 46 inch TV inside and may set up a smaller TV on patio","old_desc_md5":"e8049f615df161f9ce02de1e5a72edab"},{"id":"cmpr8hcjy00dmpyhng4q1vdvr","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Social","old_title_md5":"bdcf85bd64ac1c9bb866e6164fb81698","set_desc":true,"description":"6pm\nBayou Beer Garden\n326 N Jefferson Davis Pkwy New Orleans, Louisiana 70119\nHash Erections night\n\nHash erections","old_desc_md5":"2ba70b39551753a3254c11c4f4873a0e"},{"id":"cmpr8hcri00dopyhnub32xyf9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1167","old_title_md5":"bee3c9dcbfaf0e62fbba6a4040400e0e","set_hares":true,"hares":"Only Oral & Little Red Head","old_hares_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":1167,"old_run":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: Only Oral & Little Red Head\nLOC: corner of Camp St & Race St\n$5 Hash\n12:00 Show / 12:30 Go\n\nSaints Home Game at 3:05pm\nOn-After: McGuire's 869 Magazine Street, New Orleans, LA","old_desc_md5":"cf7389693ebf7a2ff38a5dd7dd5d21e9"},{"id":"cmpr8hdcd00dupyhnowpecitu","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1168","old_title_md5":"ec98128c894330689e922bde35430c03","set_hares":true,"hares":"OCR & Little Red Head","old_hares_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":1168,"old_run":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: OCR & Little Red Head\nLOC: Belle Chasse at the corner of Barrierre Road and Good News\n$7 Hash\n10:00am Show / 10:30 Go\nclick below for important details.\n\nSaints away game Noon.\nOCR was unfortunate enough to have picked this lump of coal at our Christmas party.\nFee is $7, or a $2 discount if you wear Tampa football attire; shirt, hat, etc. ya know, a \"buck-an-ear\". Rendering it to $5.\nYes, it's early & on the WB. IBF, now so have ya'll! On-out!\n\nBut seriously, I realize that we normally hash at 3:00 when the Saints play at 1:00, but with all the other holidays things going on (parties, caroling at Jackson square, just to name a few) I wanted to free people up for later in the afternoon. The meeting spot is across the street from Sudz, normally they have hot dogs, burgers, nachos during the game, and only $2.25 ice cold long necks.","old_desc_md5":"27fd31b27ac42e13264cfe8ec57b197f"},{"id":"cmpr8hdw300e0pyhnr3z5bj2h","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1169","old_title_md5":"f0cb4394ed3261686f71a5c4ee6548ac","set_hares":true,"hares":"Kiss My Trassh, Piston Penis, & TuHiTuCum","old_hares_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":1169,"old_run":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: Kiss My Trassh, Piston Penis, & TuHiTuCum\nLOC: across from Cooter Brown's\n$6 Hash - 2:30 Show / 3:00 Go\n\nNo Saints game today. 2:30 meet and 3:00 on out. Start at Cooter Browns on the corner of S. Carrollton and Leake Ave. This will be an A- B (short walk back to vehicles).","old_desc_md5":"ddfe015f7f0eeabc0d317730cf7c3b0d"},{"id":"cmpr8he5h00e2pyhnnb539jly","set_title":true,"title":"Winter Tour de Liquor bike ride","old_title_md5":"760ab4c321e93296fd062750b7218337","set_desc":true,"description":"9am\nParlays Dream Lounge\n870 Harrison Ave NOLA\n\nMeet us at Parlay's for Bloody Mary's and Mimosas at 9/9:30am before we take off at 10:30ish am. BYOB and $$ for the remainder of the day. Jello Shots available. Watching the Saints game somewhere at the end.","old_desc_md5":"6c32675f7f53cc079a9ea9a7a72c0e0c"},{"id":"cmpr8herb00e8pyhncfpwmqti","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1170","old_title_md5":"b7b6a74edd97a45b253e3117dabc6a15","set_hares":true,"hares":"Mystery Hares were Piston Penis, Tidybowl Man, Wishbone","old_hares_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":1170,"old_run":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: Mystery Hares were Piston Penis, Tidybowl Man, Wishbone\nLOC: McGuires\n$5 Hash\n3pmShow / 3:30 Go\n\nSaints Home Game at NOON. We will meet at McGuire's to watch the game and the hash will begin after the game ends.","old_desc_md5":"9fbbe2f64902f3d5caecc87e46837cee"},{"id":"cmpr8hfh500eepyhnyhtb4be6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1171 King's Day Hash","old_title_md5":"70cf76ea7e1613d073fafdd871028b94","set_hares":true,"hares":"Snatch Shot","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: Snatch Shot\nLOC: Washington Square\n$6 Hash\n12:00Show / 12:30 Go\n\nSaints Game is at 3:30pm today.\nOur Kings Day Hash is the start of the Mardi Gras Season, so dress like it and let's show the neighborhood that the real New Orleans holidays have begun.","old_desc_md5":"21824a54cc2ded2dcfd28eb1eb728680"},{"id":"cmpr8hgas00empyhnx1d56sq9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1172","old_title_md5":"c98d9337071d8547e0d2c83984ca5bdd","set_hares":true,"hares":"IME & Fire in the Hole","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hares: IME & Fire in the Hole\nLOC: Parlay's on Harrison\n$5 Hash\n3:00Show / 3:30Go","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8hnh600gcpyhn665w26nf","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1181","old_title_md5":"2d63ee5376fa22d30ed2eaa54082fff8","set_hares":true,"hares":"EBS & Chum Dumpster","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Irish Italian parade. Hares: EBS & Chum Dumpster. LOC: Chase Bank - Corner of Vets & Homestead\n$6 Hash\nTime: 11:30 Show 12:00 Go\n\nIt's the Irish/Italian Parade. Tank & PS Knave will be roasting a pig out on the parade route. So come out and celebrate your Irish/Italian-ness. We'll be set up behind the Chase Bank on the corner of Homestead & Veterans.","old_desc_md5":"c5b759c8caa47fad094d99c7d0c41dcb"},{"id":"cmpr8hque00h4pyhnidmfdhjb","set_title":true,"title":"CCC Crescent City Classic","old_title_md5":"d3e347ca96be888b755080109c168d77","set_desc":true,"description":"VIP Tent at the Practice Field behind Tad Gormley Stadium\n\nPlease volunteer to pour beer inside the event. $3 Entry fee to the CCC Event itself.\nHash VIP Tent at the Practice Field. $10 adults/$5 kids. Beer and BBQ.\nhttp://www.ccc10k.com/site.php?pageID=3","old_desc_md5":"c2a035e9c33cbe3c7c6508ae6e418f1b"},{"id":"cmlrhx6b7000a04jprtbb5a8a","set_desc":true,"description":"Who/Hare(s):\nBuck-a-Fuffalo & Lichtenschtabbed\n\nWe Tried this once & Mother Nature had other plans. So we are trying to do this again. Hopefully the snow will stay away this time. You all have a duo of guest hares coming into town & they are huge patch whores & would like to show you all a good old fashioned hash trail!!\n(Insert Evil Laugh)\n\nWhat to bring:\n****HEADLAMP / FLASHLIGHT !!!!****\nHash cash for Trail\nMoney for Hab!!!\nClean/Dry/Warm clothes & shoes\nVirgins!!!!\nTRAIL TYPE: A to A\nVessel - who wants to drink from a can?\nWhistle\nAppetite for a trail!?!?!","old_desc_md5":"50935cd762d0664f3ac60e52f5152ab9"},{"id":"cmlrhx6bv000c04jpg8ihiuqz","set_desc":true,"description":"Dog friendly, some water, some shiggy.\n4 miles.\n\nOn-After: Mark's Pub","old_desc_md5":"0cfd3cfd26f358fa969c2bbcf27316de"},{"id":"cmlrhx6d3000g04jpnlb7tmi5","set_desc":true,"description":"The Masters Tournament is this weekend! Drive for show and putt for dough!\n\nBut also - https://youtube.com/shorts/s18-zrjNYyA?si=MXdIwDQyNcg9UHlo\n\nAnd Mouth Full gets her SH!T Hare-Ginia Challenge patch!\n\nOn-After: Buffalo Wild Wings\n11204 James Swart Cir, Fairfax, VA 22030\n$4 tall Goose Island Kolsch!\n$5 tall Bud Lights!\n$5-$6 late night app menu!\n\nFree exclamation points!!!!!","old_desc_md5":"b8842816c1ab94a185d8ff419e24bdc2"},{"id":"cmlrhx6dv000i04jp7kovd65u","set_desc":true,"description":"This is a double metro trail! One, it is metro accessible! Two, we'll be riding the metro as part of trail\n\nIf folks have their own metro cards, they should bring them. The hare will have some spare cards to pass out.","old_desc_md5":"0d8b2729ceb04cce15801cbd3e2ebd90"},{"id":"cmlrhx6em000k04jp6t6cplu3","set_desc":true,"description":"Runners 3.x and Walkers 2.x. dog friendly, wet feet.\n\nOn-After: Marks Pub\n2190 Pimmit Dr Falls Church","old_desc_md5":"5256ff592ae880d64d90a2421ad8ca64"},{"id":"cmlrhx6fv000m04jpxwh37xnf","set_desc":true,"description":"On-After: On-On-On: Chuy's: (or whatever it's called now...)\": at: \"21365 Epicerie Plaza, Sterling, VA. 20164\" (or wherever you've gotten lost!).\nD'ERECTIONS:\nFROM \"START\": (depending where you parked)...\nFrom START... it's across the street at: \"21365 Epicerie Plaza, Sterling, VA. 20164\"","old_desc_md5":"3d5edcc2822bc948179d87073a96fc41"},{"id":"cmlrhx6gt000o04jp2p97qv62","set_desc":true,"description":"Runners 5 Shiggy 4ish miles\nWalkers 2 Shiggy 2ish miles","old_desc_md5":"a39f658cc210a18c999097568e17ca99"},{"id":"cmlrhx6ia000s04jppf77x1vh","set_desc":true,"description":"Trail #1177 - The Bunnymankini Trail!\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunny_Man\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sling_swimsuit#mankini\n\nHaving/wearing a mankini is optional, but more fun if more people do it! You can get one for $3 on Amazon in a whole array of colors.\n\nMost just wear the mankini over their running clothes during trail. What you do at end circle is up to you!\n\nOn-After: Main St Pub\n7140 Main St,\n\nClifton, VA 20124\n\nKitchen closes at 9PM (half price apps)\nBar closes at 10PM","old_desc_md5":"0e83fe0c32ab99e56f8db0c9a0e1db23"},{"id":"cmlrhx6is000u04jpjv47dqz0","set_desc":true,"description":"Sometimes... you wonder who you know or who you don't' know. There I was... scouting trail (and just don't assume that I'm running with the Great Falls Hash House Harriers in order to steal their Saturday trail for Tuesday, because that would be just wrong!!) and I'm running (if you can call it that) West on the bike trail when some strange voice (however lovely it was) yells behind me... \"And How's Her\"!!\nWho is going to figure who I am from the backside? Is my ass to big? Is it the awesome gait of mine?\nSo... I scouted out this awesome (less than four miles) true trail and finished back at the Caboose Brewing Company & Tavern only to find a bunch of bikers there. It was not hard to tell who the sexy, spandex wearing biker gear voice was... none other than the lovely, \"Cruisin for Vajucin\"!!\nOkay... in reality, she saw a 'non' GFHer wearing hashing gear and then recognized Whack'n Spurt prior to 'guessing' who I was!! I invited her up to the OnOnOn and gave her a little history of the GFH3... a much older group that's been around for some 42 years!!\n\nOn-After: Caboose Brewing Company & Tavern: (or whatever it's called now...)\": at: \"520 Mill Street, Vienna, VA 22180\" or \"Vienna Inn\" (or wherever you've gotten lost!).","old_desc_md5":"f10b62fdff3d3e9d78d2a447ea0a13ed"},{"id":"cmlrhx6ky001004jpe5dvzjfs","set_desc":true,"description":"Hares:\nHugs High-five Ghost and Just Sean\n\nDate:\nJune 17, 2025\n\nLocation: Behind the Giant\n8941 Ox Road, Lorton, VA 22079\n\nWhen: Hares away at 7:00pm. Pack off at 7:15pm\n\nWhat to expect\nJoin Hugs for her first haring adventure without Sorest. Be on the lookout for blue herons on trail and bring your boots for line dancing at the On After.\nRunners: 4\nWalkers: 2\n\nPre-Lube: Fusebox\n8961 Ox Road, Lorton, VA 22079\nHappy Hour 4-7pm (All draft beer $2.00 off)\n\nOn-After: Madigans\n201 Mill Street, Occoquan, VA 22125\nSorest is going to teach some line dances\n\nOn-After: 201 Mill Street, Occoquan, VA 22125","old_desc_md5":"0329b180d79970274f8166f75f5566c6"},{"id":"cmlrhx6lv001204jpnv735wxk","set_desc":true,"description":"Trail #3369 - The Country Swing Dance Trail!\n\nWhat's country swing? How does it differ from west coast swing east coast swing? How does it differ from swinging and upside down pineapples?\n\nFind out none of the answers at Tuesday's trail!\n\nLet's do a trail, name Just Meg, and then embarrass ourselves country swing dancing.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/DKcAblhgSW3/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\n\nLessons from 8-9PM for the NLCers!\n\nOn-After: Crooked Run Fermentation/Nectar Cocktail Bar (closes at 11PM on Tuesdays)\n22455 Davis Dr #120,\nSterling, VA 20164\nThere may be a $10 cover if you're dancing (but we're showing up late, so maybe not?). No cover if you're just going to hang at the bar and creepily watch girls dance.\nBoth Crooked Run and Nectar Cocktail Bar will be open til 11PM (connected via hallway). Kitchen closes at 9PM but will have slices for sale past 9PM.","old_desc_md5":"ea1bcf29b72352973892c466826c0744"},{"id":"cmlrhx6my001404jpe3h8vdj7","set_desc":true,"description":"In commemoration of National Postal Workers day, your trail will be cumming to you courtesy of some mail escorts.\nIt is said that mail escorts suffer some of the harshest working conditions, yet continue to persevere six days a week. On the seventh day they go hashing. There may also be a special delivery of shiggy.\n\nOn-After: Don Luis Restaurant - Cantina","old_desc_md5":"5bfd50685cb474b8c244e88e5bb05c8f"},{"id":"cmlrhx6nt001604jpwxwvvex9","set_desc":true,"description":"Trail starts in the parking lot across from the Art Center (across from the painted butterfly) and behind Sully's.\n750 Center St. Herndon Va.\nUm... maybe these \"veteran\" or \"rookie\" hares want to prove they won't get you lost on a trail? Maybe we are trail-loving not so secretly Foodie-loving hares, who want to celebrate National Cow Day, National Freezer Pop AND National Sundae\nDay (shouldn't that be on a Sundae?) Or Chocolate with Almonds Day. What exactly is a Black Kow and how does it taste!? Cum if you're hungry, or if you like to spend time in the mud with your friends, or if like to sing Karaoke (we can't sing! - except Upper Cunt, she's got nice pipes!) or just... cum if you like to.... we often do....\nSully's Pourhouse Path:\nLeave the everyday behind and surrender to the temptations of the Sully's Pourhouse Path. This trail isn't just a walk; it's a flirtation with the untamed. Imagine dappled sunlight teasing your skin, the scent of damp earth and a bit of primal energy. This is where nature sheds its inhibitions, revealing a vibrant, sensuous side. And when your journey culminates, Sully's Pourhouse awaits, a perfect culmination to your sensory adventure.\nStart Address: Behind Sully's Pourhouse and the artsy place. Look....ing for the wall with the painted butterfly:\n750 Center St, Herndon, VA 20170\nCranium lamp recommended for undisclosed reasons.\nYou could bring golf clubs, a skateboard, or even a tennis racket.\nUm... we will ask for sunshine, but you might want to get wet? We often do...\nHares: Whorganic, Pimmb, Shea Coco Butt Hurts, Polish Face Polish, Phoof There It Is.\nMaybe mysterious nymphs in the forest.\nPrelube:\n530pm Sully's Pourhouse\n630pm arrival for prompt 7pm hares away. 715 pack away.\nWalkers ~ 3 miles. More trails than sidewalk, light to no shiggy.\nRunners ~5+ miles Turkey/Eagle, you might survive. Hares from Pa like to run. Just sayin.\nOn On On: Sully's Pourhouse for libations, food for the foodies and yes, Karaoke okay, we will likely drop the mic now... ttyl!\n\nOn-After: Sully's for karaoke","old_desc_md5":"b5ae621eb7e8f8af0db9db13948a9b39"},{"id":"cmlrhx6pf001c04jp14u3yijn","set_desc":true,"description":"If you think it's going to be hot\nTake a dip in the lake and it's not\nHave fun on the trail\nHave some wine or an ale\nLet's see what this damn dam has got!\n\nIt's Hugs and Just Sean once again\nBring a virgin or some other friend\nWe're sure you'll have fun\nOn this cool four mile run\nOr a two mile walk around the bend\n\nOn-After: Glory Days\n9526 Old Keene Mill Rd, Burke, VA","old_desc_md5":"c93b6cb77a91487117a61cd1067c6527"},{"id":"cmlrhx6rk001k04jpi3rvqyoh","set_desc":true,"description":"PIIMMB found out how to make cheap shirts!\n\nBYO blank shirt to trail in a bag and write on a piece of paper your hash name and naming story. Shirt has to be at least 70% polyester and lighter colors are prefered over dark.\n\nThen in a future trail (date TBD) you'll get your shirt back with a (hopefully) cool design on it!\n\nOn-After: Prelube:\n\nSushi Kabuki (sake bombs, anyone?)\n\n2533 John Milton Dr,\nHerndon, VA 20171\n\nOnOnOn:\n\nGlory Days\n2567 John Milton Dr,\n\nHerndon, VA 20171","old_desc_md5":"c1fb84cd4c435dcdeb560b275e376568"},{"id":"cmlrhx6so001o04jpvn31msye","set_desc":true,"description":"Burke center VRE area. Look for marks and sketchy sh*t.\nSummer is OVER. Do you even remember how to hash?","old_desc_md5":"57513872e7eb4ef99a8fae45da91232b"},{"id":"cmlrhx6tp001s04jpxn65cfl5","set_desc":true,"description":"Did you know there is a Lake Mercer in Antarctica? Well, we're not going to that\none. There's one in Fairfax too! Just Sean is back in college but join Hugs on the\nNot-Antarctica Lake Mercer Trail. 4 miles runners, 2 miles walkers, some shiggy\nand bring head lamps.\n\nOn-After: Glory Days\n9526 Old Keene Mill Rd, Burke, VA","old_desc_md5":"dee364519233ab1a7ac0681adc008ed0"},{"id":"cmlrhx6u7001u04jpla1qhr42","set_desc":true,"description":"After 6 months, Sorest traveled all around the state to hare for all the Virginia kennels, except for Great Falls (f*ck them!) and Elbow Deep in Damascus, VA! Let's celebrate!\n\nOn-After: OnOnOn: Blue Iguana\n12727 Shoppes Ln, Fairfax, VA 22033","old_desc_md5":"1b00b9023856142cd3e83994baced13b"},{"id":"cmlrhx6vd001y04jpx7k7wfyr","set_desc":true,"description":"PreLube @ Bike Lane\n11150 Sunset Hills Rd STE 110, Reston, VA 20190\n\nOn-After: Red's Table\n11150 South Lakes Dr, Reston, VA 20191","old_desc_md5":"d4967adcd47ee03a331cd0c08ea2608e"},{"id":"cmlrhx6wl002204jpq8ohgoua","set_desc":true,"description":"Wear a costume and let's get weird looks from the muggles at Tysons Mall! Finish up with playing some games at the new Level 99!\nNo trail, other than finding your way to the next bar!\nRecommended parking garage: Tysons One Pl and Westpark Dr Tysons, VA 22102\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/LuLkDimVvFRQ9Txw8\nEarl's Kitchen & Bar\n5:00-6:00\nhttps://earls.ca/locations/tysons-corner/\nHighball Crushes (1oz) - 1/2 PRICE\nCorona ( 330 ml) - 3 OFF\nStella Artois (50 cl) - 3 OFF\nEarls Old Fashioned - 1/2 PRICE\nMoscow Mule (1 oz) - 1/2 PRICE\nNitro Espresso Martini - 1/2 PRICE\nGreen Tea Shot - $5\nMini Strawberry Margarita Shot - $5\nTiny Tini Peach Bellini - $5\n\nBarrel & Bushel\n6:00-7:00\nhttps://www.barrelandbushel.com/\n$2 Off Selected Draft Beers\n$6 House Wines - Pinot Grigio, Chardonnay, Merlot, Cabernet Sauvignon\n$7 Rail Mixed Drinks - Vodka, Bourbon, Whiskey, Tequila, Gin, Rum, Scotch\n$2 Off Select Share Plates - Loaded Tots, Hearth Pretzel with Cheese Sauce & Mustard, Pimento Deviled Eggs, 72 Hour Pork Belly, Hot Fried Crispy Chicken Sliders, Pub Sliders\n\nLevel 99 / Victory Brewing\n7:30-9:30\nhttps://www.level99.com/?loc=tysons-va\nThere are 50+ rooms with games (physical, mental, skill) that take 1-3 minutes\n$30 for 2 hours\nVictory Brewing is attached for those who don't want to play.\nCan bring booze into the rooms!\nHave to leave early but want to see the games? You can go in to watch for free!\nKids? Sure, if it's not past their bedtime.\n\nEarl's Kitchen & Bar\n10:00-Midnight\nhttps://earls.ca/locations/tysons-corner/\nHighball Crushes (1oz) - 1/2 PRICE\nCorona ( 330 ml) - 3 OFF\nStella Artois (50 cl) - 3 OFF\nEarls Old Fashioned - 1/2 PRICE\nMoscow Mule (1 oz) - 1/2 PRICE\nNitro Espresso Martini - 1/2 PRICE\nGreen Tea Shot - $5\nMini Strawberry Margarita Shot - $5\nTiny Tini Peach Bellini - $5\nHares:\nSorest Rump (in spirit), Wookin Pa Nub, Mystery Hare(s)\nDate:\nOctober 28, 2025\nNotes:\nNo hash cash! Pay as you go bar crawl! Maybe a shot check!\nCostume optional, but more fun if everyone participates!\nRecommended parking garage:\nTysons One Pl and Westpark Dr\nTysons, VA 22102\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/LuLkDimVvFRQ9Txw8","old_desc_md5":"f081e7e418bea6f381e1bd7b7f0318cb"},{"id":"cmlrhx6xa002404jpwh65lf0s","set_desc":true,"description":"Park Behind Kilroys.\n\nYou wanted: Easy, fun, themed trail with hot sauce, games, hot chicks and costumes?\nYou're getting: trails, fun, mud, confusion, a theme song, hot chicks, and beer. Oh well.\nTheme Song: https://tinyurl.com/52vjjwjk\nHares: Mysterious, sexy, intelligent, fun-loving.\nBring the usual. It's a hash, and the hares always lie.\nRunners = 4.5\nWalkers = 2 See less\n\nOn-After: 5250a Port Royal Rd, Springfield, VA 22151","old_desc_md5":"d6e10956f4659f8912bc4043cd0b0ac8"},{"id":"cmlrhx6xu002604jpesb24cev","set_desc":true,"description":"Let's hoist our favorite beverage to our military and veterans! 4 miles runners, 2 miles walkers, some shiggy and bring head lamps.\nHares Away: 7:00 PM\nStart:\nBunnyman Brewing in Burke\n5583 Guinea Rd\nFairfax, VA\n***Closed on Tuesdays so no prelube or on after there but still a good start location\nOn-After:\nGlory Days\n9526 Old Keene Mill Rd, Burke, VA","old_desc_md5":"86b9fd40c3b59bbecc5b19c9744b6088"},{"id":"cmlrhx6zo002c04jprh3bwhp2","set_desc":true,"description":"Delicate Flower AKA nub turns old again!\nStart at Glory Days (temporarily closed).\nHare: Fingerrrgrgrgrgrrrr & mystery hare.\nRun: ~4mi\nWalk:~2mi","old_desc_md5":"6ed683dc2b058053c96aa5c42d9ab38e"},{"id":"cmnwb4hi7000804jxalwmczln","set_desc":true,"description":"SLOTH 105:\nHare: OnlyTeeth\nHash cash: $10\nStart: Fairmont Aquatic Center 1044 Sugarmont Dr, Salt Lake City, UT 84106 40.72227229540586,-111.86138846195072\nFinish: There Will Be An On-After.\n\nSome may refer to this as a race(ist) trail, hangover trail, throwback trail, whatever.\nIt's more simply a stripped down (giggity), back to basics trail where people can get a run in.\nIn regards to this being a r*nning trail:\nWe do NOT ask that you run fast.\nWe do NOT ask that you run the entire trail.\nWe DOask that you do NOT come to trail expecting to walk the whole thing.\nThis trail will cover all 4 objectives of hashing:\nTo promote physical fitness among our members.\nTo get rid of weekend hangovers.\nTo acquire a good thirst and to satisfy it in beer.\nTo persuade the older members that they are not as old as they feel.a","old_desc_md5":"806e3649d5785e0c9ea15045449eaa32"},{"id":"cmnwb4krg001104jxs8qt49hn","set_desc":true,"description":"A has been posted on the Events calendar on the Whoreman website. https://www.whoremanh3.com/events-trails/\n\nSmorg is Hiding somewhere in the Mountains near PC. Let’s go find (snare) him. Last one in buys the 1st round!\n\nTake the Summit Park exit off I-80, then up to the Short Stack Trailhead. Carpools are being formed ask around!!\n\nSLOSH 107:\nHare: SmorgAssWhore\nHash cash: $10\nStart: Short Stack Trailhead\nFinish: There Might! Be An On-After.\n\nSome may refer to this as a race(ist) trail, hangover trail, throwback trail, whatever.\nIt's more simply a stripped down (giggity), back to basics trail where people can get a run in.\nIn regards to this being a r*nning trail:\nWe do NOT ask that you run fast.\nWe do NOT ask that you run the entire trail.\nWe DOask that you do NOT com